From: CoWave Fall <105500745+CoWave-Fall@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] button: gpio: apply the default pinctrl state after requesting GPIOs

Applied to U-Boot v2026.10.

Signed-off-by: CoWave Fall <105500745+CoWave-Fall@users.noreply.github.com>

--- a/drivers/button/button-gpio.c
+++ b/drivers/button/button-gpio.c
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 #include <button.h>
 #include <dm.h>
 #include <dm/lists.h>
+#include <dm/pinctrl.h>
 #include <dm/uclass-internal.h>
 #include <log.h>
 #include <asm/gpio.h>
@@ -59,6 +60,17 @@
 	if (ret || !dm_gpio_is_valid(&priv->gpio))
 		return ret;
 
+	/*
+	 * PMIC GPIO 在 direction_input 时会把上拉写成“无上拉”，悬空引脚
+	 * 的读数会漂移。请求 GPIO 之后按设备树重新应用 pinctrl 默认状态，
+	 * 让 bias-pull-up 生效。状态通常写在 gpio-keys 父节点上。
+	 */
+	ret = pinctrl_select_state(dev, "default");
+	if (ret)
+		ret = pinctrl_select_state(dev->parent, "default");
+	if (ret && ret != -ENOSYS)
+		return ret;
+
 	ret = dev_read_u32(dev, "linux,code", &priv->linux_code);
 
 	return ret;
